            "authorName": "blt-tasks[bot]",
            "body": "## Context\n\n`scripts/build_showcase.py` always emits `<img src=\"{preview_url}\">` (in `build_card`, `summary_card` and the winner showcase). Four `blt-video-meme` entries have `.mp4` previews, so `public/blt-video-meme.html` and `show-all-entries.html` show broken images.\n\n## What to do\n\n1. Add an `is_video(url)` helper (`.mp4|.webm|.mov`) and render `<video muted playsinline preload=\"metadata\" controls aria-label=...>` in those three places.\n2. Add a test in `tests/test_build_showcase.py` and rebuild `public/` with `--offline`.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Video entries play or show a poster frame\n- [ ] No `<img src=\"*.mp4\">` in `public/`\n- [ ] Tests pass\n\n## How to test locally\n\n```bash\npython3 blt-design-contest/scripts/build_showcase.py --offline --out /tmp/contest && python3 -m http.server 8080 --directory /tmp/contest\nscripts/ci/test.sh blt-design-contest\n```\n\n---\nSize: **S**. Comment `/assign` to claim this issue; claims with no activity are released after 7 days. Clone from https://git.owaspblt.org/BLT.git and open your pull request there.\n",
